<td>⚠️ Needs improvement</td>
<td>Refund policy missing from homepage</td>
<td>Add within 24 hours</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3>Issue Classification</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Severe</strong>: Immediately pause related ads, adjust before relaunching</li>
<li><strong>Moderate</strong>: Complete remediation within 24 hours</li>
<li><strong>Minor</strong>: Add to next week's optimization plan</li>
</ul>
<hr />
